# Optional fallbacks for provider API keys. Prefer the Settings screen.
# Each variable is read only when that provider is the active choice
# and Settings has no saved key. Never commit real keys.

# XAI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Publisher calendar / Drive OAuth clients (Spencer / CI only).
# End users never paste these — Settings is Connect / Disconnect only.
# Local: copy to `.env` (gitignored). Release: GitHub Actions secrets
# with the same names; electron-vite injects them into the main build.
# Do not invent placeholder ids. Missing id → Connect error for maintainers.

# MEETREC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
# MEETREC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
# MEETREC_MICROSOFT_CLIENT_ID=
